  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。スコヴィランから　抽出した成分を配合した　ピリッとした　ソース。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "매운맛이 강한 조미료. 스코빌런에게서 추출한 성분을 배합해서 만든 알싸한 소스다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味強勁的調味料。加入萃取自狠辣椒的成分，調製而成的辛辣醬料。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût très épicé. C’est un ingrédient produit par des Scovilain qui donne à cette sauce sa saveur si particulière.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das feurige Prickeln, das dieses sehr scharfe Würzmittel auf der Zunge auslöst, ist den Scharfstoffen von Halupenjo zu verdanken.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El extracto de Scovillain hace de este un condimento muy picante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento molto piccante. L’effetto bruciante di questa salsa è causato da elementi provenienti da Scovillain mescolati insieme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment with a very spicy kick. It’s thanks to Scovillain that this sauce gets its signature mouth- tingling burn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　調味料。スコヴィランから　抽出した成分を配合した　ピリッとした　ソース。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味强烈的调味料。使用从狠辣椒抽出的成分调制而成的刺激酱汁。",
